# BROWSER-carousel.md — LinkedIn Document / Carousel Publishing

**Read ON-DEMAND only** when a `publish_carousel` task is due. Apply BROWSER-core.md globally (shadow DOM, evaluate-over-snapshot, tab reuse).

**Inputs** (Content Writer emits into `{{pipeline_workspace}}/content-ready/{today_date}/`):
- `linkedin-carousel.spec.json` — per-slide DATA (schema in content-writer AGENT.md §14)
- `linkedin-carousel.md` — frontmatter (`status: pending`, `title:`, `spec_source:`) + 150-250 word commentary + hashtags. If writer skipped, this file is just `skipped: {reason}` and spec.json won't exist.

**Outputs:** HTML + PDF at `/tmp/opentwins-uploads/{today_date}-linkedin-carousel.{html,pdf}`, published post, memory log, `weekly.carousels.current += 1`.

**Renderer:** `{{pipeline_workspace}}/content-writer/templates/render-carousel.mjs` (Node, zero deps).

---

## Preflight checks

```bash
DATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)
DOW=$(date +%u)   # 1=Mon … 2=Tue … 5=Fri … 7=Sun
SPEC={{pipeline_workspace}}/content-ready/${DATE}/linkedin-carousel.spec.json
DOC={{pipeline_workspace}}/content-ready/${DATE}/linkedin-carousel.md
HTML=/tmp/opentwins-uploads/${DATE}-linkedin-carousel.html
PDF=/tmp/opentwins-uploads/${DATE}-linkedin-carousel.pdf
RENDERER={{pipeline_workspace}}/content-writer/templates/render-carousel.mjs

# Tue (2) + Fri (5) = MANDATORY carousel days per PLAYBOOK. Anything missing on these days is an Alert, not a routine skip.
is_mandatory_day() { [ "$DOW" = "2" ] || [ "$DOW" = "5" ]; }

mkdir -p /tmp/opentwins-uploads

fail_mandatory() { echo "ALERT: mandatory carousel day ${DATE} — $1. NO fallback. Investigate upstream."; exit 0; }
fail_optional()  { echo "CarouselSkipped: $1"; exit 0; }

test -f "$DOC" || { is_mandatory_day && fail_mandatory "no linkedin-carousel.md"; fail_optional "no .md"; }
grep -q "^skipped:" "$DOC" && { is_mandatory_day && fail_mandatory "writer marked skipped"; fail_optional "writer_skipped"; }
test -f "$SPEC" || { is_mandatory_day && fail_mandatory "no spec.json"; fail_optional "no spec"; }
grep -q "^status: pending" "$DOC" || { echo "already published"; exit 0; }
test -f "$RENDERER" || { echo "Type=Error Reason=renderer_not_found"; exit 1; }
```

Tue/Fri = mandatory: any missing/skipped fires Alert (day has no primary publish). Other days: routine skip. Renderer missing = hard error.

