## SS-C2. Open post composer + navigate to document upload

```bash
# Expects: {{browser_profile}} profile already logged in, at https://www.linkedin.com/feed/
exec curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3847/api/browser/{{browser_profile}}/evaluate -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @- <<'ENDJSON'
{"fn":"async () => { await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 3500)); var startBtn = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('div, button')).find(function(el) { return (el.innerText || '').trim() === 'Start a post' && (el.getAttribute('role') === 'button' || el.tagName === 'BUTTON'); }); if (!startBtn) return { success: false, reason: 'no_start_post_btn' }; startBtn.click(); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 4000)); var host = document.querySelector('#interop-outlet'); if (!host || !host.shadowRoot) return { success: false, reason: 'no_shadow_root' }; var shadow = host.shadowRoot; var editor = shadow.querySelector('[contenteditable=\"true\"][role=\"textbox\"]'); if (!editor) return { success: false, reason: 'modal_did_not_open' }; var more = Array.from(shadow.querySelectorAll('button')).find(function(b) { return b.getAttribute('aria-label') === 'More'; }); if (!more) return { success: false, reason: 'no_more_btn' }; more.click(); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 1500)); var docBtn = Array.from(shadow.querySelectorAll('button')).find(function(b) { return b.getAttribute('aria-label') === 'Add a document'; }); if (!docBtn) return { success: false, reason: 'no_add_document_option' }; docBtn.click(); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2000)); var label = Array.from(shadow.querySelectorAll('label')).find(function(l) { return (l.innerText || '').trim() === 'Choose file'; }); return { success: true, chooseFileReady: !!label, forAttr: label ? label.getAttribute('for') : null }; }"}
ENDJSON
```

Dialog has a `<label>Choose file</label>` (not a button) bound to a hidden `<input type=file accept=".doc,.docx,.pdf,.ppt,.pptx">`. On `modal_did_not_open`: retry once after 3s, then skip. Other failures: log `Type=Error Reason={reason}`, skip.

