## SS-C5. Type commentary in main editor

Pass the commentary body via `data.text` (from `linkedin-carousel.md` body). Agent JSON-escapes quotes/newlines/backslashes when substituting.

```bash
exec curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3847/api/browser/{{browser_profile}}/evaluate -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @- <<'ENDJSON'
{"fn":"async () => { var host = document.querySelector('#interop-outlet'); var shadow = host.shadowRoot; var editor = shadow.querySelector('[contenteditable=\"true\"][role=\"textbox\"]') || shadow.querySelector('.ql-editor[role=\"textbox\"]'); if (!editor) return { success: false, reason: 'no_editor' }; editor.focus(); var text = window.__data.text; var lines = text.split(String.fromCharCode(10)); editor.innerHTML = lines.map(function(l) { return '<p>' + (l.trim() === '' ? '<br>' : l) + '</p>'; }).join(''); editor.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 1000)); var postBtn = Array.from(shadow.querySelectorAll('button')).find(function(b) { return (b.innerText || '').trim() === 'Post' && !b.disabled; }); return { success: !!postBtn, typed: true, chars: editor.innerText.length, postReady: !!postBtn }; }", "data": {"text": "COMMENTARY_BODY_HERE"}}
ENDJSON
```

Target 150-250 words (LinkedIn caps at 3,000 chars).

