## SS-C6. Click Post + verify

```bash
exec curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3847/api/browser/{{browser_profile}}/evaluate -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @- <<'ENDJSON'
{"fn":"async () => { var host = document.querySelector('#interop-outlet'); var shadow = host.shadowRoot; var postBtn = Array.from(shadow.querySelectorAll('button')).find(function(b) { return (b.innerText || '').trim() === 'Post' && !b.disabled; }); if (!postBtn) return { success: false, reason: 'post_btn_not_ready' }; postBtn.click(); for (var i = 0; i < 10; i++) { await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 1000)); var editorGone = !shadow.querySelector('[contenteditable=\"true\"][role=\"textbox\"]'); if (editorGone) break; } await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2500)); var links = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('a')); var postLink = links.find(function(a) { return (a.href || '').includes('/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:') || (a.href || '').includes('/feed/update/urn:li:activity:'); }); return { success: true, editorGone: true, postUrl: postLink ? postLink.href : null }; }"}
ENDJSON
```

On `post_btn_not_ready`: retry once after 3s. Still not ready → dismiss modal (`aria-label="Dismiss"` → "Discard"), log error, do NOT mark done.

If `editorGone: true` but no `postUrl`: LinkedIn feed delay. Navigate `/in/{{handle_slug}}/recent-activity/all/` and verify the document activity before logging success.

