## Error recovery

| Symptom | Action |
|---|---|
| `no_start_post_btn` / `modal_did_not_open` | retry once after 3s, then skip |
| `no_add_document_option` | LinkedIn removed for this account — skip, alert human |
| upload failed | widen `timeoutMs` to 90000, retry once |
| `done_never_enabled` | PDF rejected (check size + accept filter `.doc,.docx,.pdf,.ppt,.pptx`), re-render, retry once |
| `done_disabled_after_title` | trim title to 90 chars, strip non-printable, retry |
| `post_btn_not_ready` | wait 3s, retry once; else dismiss modal + log error |
| `editorGone: true` but no `postUrl` | navigate `/in/{{handle_slug}}/recent-activity/all/` and verify |
